 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.3,
   "text": "In this town, we live at the bottom of the mountain."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.above",
   "start": 2.3,
   "end": 3.7667,
   "text": "Up there, the rich live."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.going",
   "start": 3.7667,
   "end": 6.0667,
   "text": "One day, we were going to join them."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.fish",
   "start": 6.0667,
   "end": 8.6333,
   "text": "Every morning we fish, before the sun reaches us."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.steps",
   "start": 8.6333,
   "end": 10.7667,
   "text": "Nobody knows how many steps the mountain has."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.dad",
   "start": 10.7667,
   "end": 12.1333,
   "text": "My dad says nine thousand."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.why",
   "start": 12.1333,
   "end": 14.4,
   "text": "I asked why once. Nobody answered."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.rods",
   "start": 14.4,
   "end": 17.3333,
   "text": "Down here: rods, a jetty, one boat."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.hole",
   "start": 17.3333,
   "end": 19.3,
   "text": "The boat has a hole. We have a bucket."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.rain",
   "start": 19.3,
   "end": 22.1667,
   "text": "When it rains the fish bite faster. So we fish in the rain."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.stall",
   "start": 22.1667,
   "end": 24.1,
   "text": "One emerald a bucket at the stall."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.up",
   "start": 24.1,
   "end": 26.0667,
   "text": "Up there, the same bucket goes for ten."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.jar",
   "start": 26.0667,
   "end": 28.9667,
   "text": "What is left goes in the jar. My mum wrote THE TOP on it."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.price",
   "start": 28.9667,
   "end": 31.1667,
   "text": "Every year the price of the top goes up."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.good",
   "start": 31.1667,
   "end": 33.3,
   "text": "It was a good life. Wet, but good."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.care",
   "start": 33.3,
   "end": 34.9333,
   "text": "The rich did not think about us at all."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.coin",
   "start": 34.9333,
   "end": 37.3667,
   "text": "A rich kid threw a coin down at me, like I was a bird."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.want",
   "start": 37.3667,
   "end": 39.8667,
   "text": "But I wanted to see the top. Just once."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.mum",
   "start": 39.8667,
   "end": 42.5333,
   "text": "My mum said no. The jar is not for one person."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.old",
   "start": 42.5333,
   "end": 44.2667,
   "text": "The oldest man on the ladder said worse."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.two",
   "start": 44.2667,
   "end": 47.4667,
   "text": "\"Two families paid for the top. They still wave at us. Six years.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "5.more",
   "start": 47.4667,
   "end": 49.1333,
   "text": "That only made me want it more."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.basket",
   "start": 49.1333,
   "end": 51.3667,
   "text": "Once a year, a man comes down in a basket."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.coat",
   "start": 51.3667,
   "end": 53.5667,
   "text": "He wears a clean coat and buys our whole catch."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.touch",
   "start": 53.5667,
   "end": 56.2333,
   "text": "He does not touch the fish. Somebody else carries them."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.straight",
   "start": 56.2333,
   "end": 59.0667,
   "text": "While he is here, the whole town stands very straight."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.sick",
   "start": 59.0667,
   "end": 60.3333,
   "text": "Then my mum got sick."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.woman",
   "start": 60.3333,
   "end": 62.5667,
   "text": "The woman who fixes everybody here shook her head."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.cure",
   "start": 62.5667,
   "end": 65.0,
   "text": "One thing fixes it. A golden apple."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.gold",
   "start": 65.0,
   "end": 68.2333,
   "text": "Eight gold. There is no gold at the bottom of this mountain."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.where",
   "start": 68.2333,
   "end": 69.9,
   "text": "I asked the woman where the apple was."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.point",
   "start": 69.9,
   "end": 71.1667,
   "text": "She pointed up."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.decide",
   "start": 71.1667,
   "end": 72.8667,
   "text": "I decided to see the top."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.try",
   "start": 72.8667,
   "end": 75.0,
   "text": "First I fished the stream. Three days."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.boot",
   "start": 75.0,
   "end": 77.7333,
   "text": "I caught a boot. Then a stick. Then a lily pad."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.other",
   "start": 77.7333,
   "end": 79.7667,
   "text": "Then the other boot. Also a hole."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.laugh",
   "start": 79.7667,
   "end": 82.9667,
   "text": "The town laughed. My mum laughed, then she coughed."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.night",
   "start": 82.9667,
   "end": 85.6,
   "text": "I fished all night, with a lantern on the jetty."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.storm",
   "start": 85.6,
   "end": 87.8667,
   "text": "I fished in the rain. Then in the storm."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.rod",
   "start": 87.8667,
   "end": 90.0,
   "text": "I sold my rod. Then the boat."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.count",
   "start": 90.0,
   "end": 93.4667,
   "text": "Nine days. Forty-one emeralds. It was not enough."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.meet",
   "start": 93.4667,
   "end": 95.3333,
   "text": "That night, the town met on the jetty."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.vote",
   "start": 95.3333,
   "end": 96.7333,
   "text": "They did not vote for the top."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.mum",
   "start": 96.7333,
   "end": 97.8,
   "text": "They voted for my mum."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.jar",
   "start": 97.8,
   "end": 99.3,
   "text": "And they put the jar in my bag."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.eleven",
   "start": 99.3,
   "end": 101.7667,
   "text": "Eleven years. Every family here."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.walk",
   "start": 101.7667,
   "end": 103.5667,
   "text": "My best friend walked me to the ladder."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.q",
   "start": 103.5667,
   "end": 105.4,
   "text": "\"What if you climb it and there is nothing up there?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "12.a",
   "start": 105.4,
   "end": 107.4,
   "text": "\"Then I will know what we were saving for.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "13.steps",
   "start": 107.4,
   "end": 110.9667,
   "text": "Nine thousand steps. I counted. My dad was right."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.night",
   "start": 110.9667,
   "end": 112.1333,
   "text": "I climbed all night."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.small",
   "start": 112.1333,
   "end": 114.9667,
   "text": "The town got smaller, then it was only lights."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.gate",
   "start": 114.9667,
   "end": 117.6667,
   "text": "At the top there is a gate. A man in a clean coat."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.count",
   "start": 117.6667,
   "end": 119.9333,
   "text": "He counted our money, then showed me the price."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.raise",
   "start": 119.9333,
   "end": 122.0,
   "text": "It had gone up. It goes up every year."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.ask",
   "start": 122.0,
   "end": 123.8333,
   "text": "\"Then sell me one golden apple,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.no",
   "start": 123.8333,
   "end": 125.5,
   "text": "\"We do not sell apples for emeralds.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "14.eight",
   "start": 125.5,
   "end": 126.8667,
   "text": "\"An apple is eight gold.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "14.shut",
   "start": 126.8667,
   "end": 130.7,
   "text": "Then he shut the gate. Up there, it is the only quick thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "15.sit",
   "start": 130.7,
   "end": 132.2333,
   "text": "I sat on the steps till dark."
  },
  {
   "id": "15.street",
   "start": 132.2333,
   "end": 136.1667,
   "text": "Through the bars I saw the top. It was a street. Just a street."
  },
  {
   "id": "16.dawn",
   "start": 136.1667,
   "end": 137.5667,
   "text": "At dawn I walked down."
  },
  {
   "id": "16.jetty",
   "start": 137.5667,
   "end": 140.6667,
   "text": "The whole town was on the jetty. Every rod. In the rain."
  },
  {
   "id": "16.allnight",
   "start": 140.6667,
   "end": 142.7,
   "text": "They had fished all night, for my mum."
  },
  {
   "id": "16.basket",
   "start": 142.7,
   "end": 144.5,
   "text": "And the man from the top was in his basket."
  },
  {
   "id": "16.year",
   "start": 144.5,
   "end": 148.9333,
   "text": "A year of fish. Every fish we catch. For one apple."
  },
  {
   "id": "17.cold",
   "start": 148.9333,
   "end": 150.4667,
   "text": "He did not do it because she was sick."
  },
  {
   "id": "17.sums",
   "start": 150.4667,
   "end": 152.8333,
   "text": "He did it because a year of fish is worth more than an apple."
  },
  {
   "id": "17.save",
   "start": 152.8333,
   "end": 155.6333,
   "text": "The top did not save my mum. The bottom did."
  },
  {
   "id": "18.ate",
   "start": 155.6333,
   "end": 158.6333,
   "text": "My mum ate the apple at midnight. By morning, she was breathing."
  },
  {
   "id": "18.jar",
   "start": 158.6333,
   "end": 161.2333,
   "text": "The jar is still full. Nobody wants the top now."
  },
  {
   "id": "18.label",
   "start": 161.2333,
   "end": 162.6333,
   "text": "Somebody took the label off."
  },
  {
   "id": "18.sub",
   "start": 162.6333,
   "end": 164.8,
   "text": "Subscribe, and cast one more line."
  }
 ],
